c_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS1WPmgQ0tiRJescfHur8wQYJcdvln6zJvZDSueY8rNAA&oe=6B047BDD"}, {"file_name": "Screen_1_PNG.png", "id": "2524679328003675", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307303_2524679331337008_505137257075015073_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=orMKqPcHsoUQ7kNvwFPOG99&_nc_oc=AdoGtUmE_AL-SkNLpeAN5-r0He5ZsJoDFyKIsNnmrBua3ou8Y4pDPTezbEUeK_1f5PQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSZLMIEiwUQZMPabqZNNXMfEqYOUldXeXTRpnoRDPwvXg&oe=6B046982"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VRSim Training", "keywords": ["training", "safety", "simulator"], "long_description": "VRSim Training turns your Meta Quest into a corporate VR training station for workplace safety and soft skills.\n\nSign in by entering the **6-digit pairing code** from your operator's dashboard at https://vrsim.training/ \u2014 no cables, no complex setup. Your instructor launches scenarios on your headset and guides the session live, seeing what you see in real time.\n\n**What you can train**\n- Fire response, first aid, and warehouse & office safety\n- AI voice role-play \u2014 talk to interactive AI characters to practice decisions and conversations in a safe environment\n\nEvery session is automatically scored and reviewed by AI, so trainers get measurable results \u2014 not just a checkbox.\n\n**Requirements:** Meta Quest 3 or Quest 3S, Wi-Fi, and an operator account at https://vrsim.training/. Built for teams in manufacturing, logistics, energy, and any organization where safety is critical.", "short_description": "Launch immersive VR safety-training simulators on your Quest, run live by your operator from the VRSim web dashboard. Pair with a 6-digit code, train, get an automatic AI review."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrsim.training/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publi